Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/majority-of-germans-see-russia-as-a-threat/a-78970396--874633454624.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/majority-of-germans-see-russia-as-a-threat/a-78970396?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">More than half of German citizens believe that Germany's security is threatened by Russia, according to the latest survey by public broadcaster ARD.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Two Reform UK officials resign amid donation breach reports</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b0117d24b91c4a86240aae2396e5c2aed9379589f27326f6046be43f22721f54</id><updated>2026-09-05T04:40:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T11:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/two-reform-uk-officials-resign-amid-donation-breach-reports/a-78958681--06d3de36e0b5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/two-reform-uk-officials-resign-amid-donation-breach-reports/a-78958681?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Channel 4 report alleges that the party officials accepted foreign donations to fund three polls, illegal under the UK's electoral law. The allegations, which the party denies, come amid its annual conference.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Police raid vehicle of suspected grid saboteur</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:971a55c7fc10fdedd4c60c3b56e8be15cdb1c5ea0448c5ad82161b2152c4127c</id><updated>2026-09-05T04:40:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T11:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-raid-vehicle-of-suspected-grid-saboteur/live-78896707--9eca88d2a553.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-police-raid-vehicle-of-suspected-grid-saboteur/live-78896707?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A suspicious object that could damage power lines has been found near a German substation for a third time this week. Meanwhile, Germany and EU partners are aiming to finalize 'return hubs' by year end.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>The hidden environmental cost of AI data centers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:545e64bf7c845764c60cf71872af51901abdea19be035441da7193a72f232e1c</id><updated>2026-09-05T04:42:27Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T11:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-hidden-environmental-cost-of-ai-data-centers/a-78789889--97109524129d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-hidden-environmental-cost-of-ai-data-centers/a-78789889?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As data centers multiply to meet AI demand, they're straining power grids, draining water supplies and reshaping the land and air around them.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Serbia: How the funeral of Ratko Mladic is dividing a nation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:64f7235b8fa4d5fa6f0c08b3f8bdc8fac3539c9ab2f7572d1baabd490ada8314</id><updated>2026-09-05T04:40:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T11:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/serbia-how-the-funeral-of-ratko-mladic-is-dividing-a-nation/a-78948890--8da48694552d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/serbia-how-the-funeral-of-ratko-mladic-is-dividing-a-nation/a-78948890?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As the Serbian government leaves the decision about Ratko Mladic's funeral arrangements to his family, international pressure on the country is mounting. How do Serbs feel about the matter?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Is Saxony-Anhalt's economy really struggling?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cb7f100d39faf1be154dcbc1385cdc89adb018eb47ac0fb80f6ebff6d13b08c8</id><updated>2026-09-05T04:40:42Z</updated><published>2026-09-04